00:10:30.167 --> 00:10:33.441
You know, my assistants
see everything that I do.

00:10:33.441 --> 00:10:34.602
They've complete ac--

00:10:34.602 --> 00:10:36.251
Steve, you access to my inbox?
- [Steve] I do.

00:10:36.251 --> 00:10:38.015
- Steve has full access to my inbox.

00:10:38.015 --> 00:10:40.851
If he sees, you know, it's
hard to do anything now

00:10:40.851 --> 00:10:41.919
not documented.

00:10:41.919 --> 00:10:43.498
If I do something that breaks...

00:10:43.498 --> 00:10:46.470
At this point he as a good
sense of what my morals are

00:10:46.470 --> 00:10:47.909
and how I roll.

00:10:47.909 --> 00:10:50.603
He would, if he saw me do something,

00:10:50.603 --> 00:10:52.808
even if it didn't have
anything to do with his world

00:10:52.808 --> 00:10:54.387
or the stuff that we do together,

00:10:54.387 --> 00:10:55.432
that breaks that compass,

00:10:55.432 --> 00:10:57.290
he would then have to question everything

00:10:57.290 --> 00:10:59.658
that I've established with
him as a moral compass.

00:10:59.658 --> 00:11:01.771
Which would then lose
the trust that we have.

00:11:01.771 --> 00:11:03.605
Which would then slow us down

00:11:03.605 --> 00:11:05.997
in all the speed that I value the most.

00:11:05.997 --> 00:11:07.042
It's speed.

00:11:07.042 --> 00:11:08.574
The fact that this whole team here,

00:11:08.574 --> 00:11:10.478
and this whole collective team here

00:11:10.478 --> 00:11:12.545
and you as a team here

00:11:12.545 --> 00:11:14.634
don't have to, once you get to know me.

00:11:14.634 --> 00:11:16.376
Once I can get over that hump.

00:11:16.376 --> 00:11:18.791
Don't have to then question anything

00:11:18.791 --> 00:11:21.368
from a moral or emotional standpoint,

00:11:21.368 --> 00:11:23.783
it adds to the speed of everything.

00:11:23.783 --> 00:11:25.315
That's what a great culture is.

00:11:25.315 --> 00:11:26.290
It's speed.

00:11:26.290 --> 00:11:28.728
You're not spending the 15
minutes a day bickering.

00:11:28.728 --> 00:11:30.354
You're not spending the four hours a day

00:11:30.354 --> 00:11:33.535
wondering if that person's
trying to ruin you.

00:11:33.535 --> 00:11:36.669
You're not doing those things
which then lets you go fast.

00:11:36.669 --> 00:11:40.663
And fast, fast, my friends
is the oxygen of winning

00:11:40.663 --> 00:11:42.915
the big, fast, important game.

00:11:42.915 --> 00:11:44.331
See it's even a game called fast.

00:11:44.331 --> 00:11:45.771
You have to be fast. (laughs)

00:11:45.771 --> 00:11:49.834
So for me, it's really
important that everything breaks

00:11:49.834 --> 00:11:52.249
the second I make that kind of decision.

00:11:52.249 --> 00:11:53.364
And there's just not enough money.

00:11:53.364 --> 00:11:54.641
I mean, I guess there's enough money,

00:11:54.641 --> 00:11:57.264
everybody has a price. (inhales deeply)

00:11:57.264 --> 00:11:58.750
A trillion? (laughs)

00:11:58.750 --> 00:12:00.608
A trillion would feel--

00:12:00.608 --> 00:12:01.769
and you know what's even funny?

00:12:01.769 --> 00:12:04.160
It's funny, even if Zach came
out of my mouth, I don't know,

00:12:04.160 --> 00:12:06.738
I don't know, I'm gonna end up,

00:12:06.738 --> 00:12:09.153
I'm gonna end up leaving a
lot of money on the table

00:12:09.153 --> 00:12:11.730
in my life because that's
not the way I score myself.

00:12:11.730 --> 00:12:13.982
I score myself on number
amount of people--

00:12:13.982 --> 00:12:16.211
The matrix of the number amount of people

00:12:16.211 --> 00:12:18.603
that come to my funeral
and the business success

00:12:18.603 --> 00:12:20.065
that I was able to create.

00:12:20.065 --> 00:12:21.552
I'd be lying if was just about

00:12:21.552 --> 00:12:23.061
everybody showing up to my funeral

00:12:23.061 --> 00:12:25.870
but then I was like, didn't
win in this game that I played,

00:12:25.870 --> 00:12:28.842
scored in business growth,
dollars, all the things, the game

00:12:28.842 --> 00:12:32.000
But a hefty push to that funeral number.

00:12:32.000 --> 00:12:34.647
Again, recently,
unfortunately in a tech space

00:12:34.647 --> 00:12:36.806
we had a beloved character pass away

00:12:36.806 --> 00:12:39.034
of CEO of Survey Monkey
that a lot of people knew.

00:12:39.034 --> 00:12:40.517
A lot of my friends knew him really well.

00:12:40.517 --> 00:12:41.809
I didn't really know him
well but it was interesting

00:12:41.809 --> 00:12:44.549
how I was affected by it
just watching the outpouring

00:12:44.549 --> 00:12:46.128
of what kind of a mensch,

00:12:46.128 --> 00:12:48.055
what kind of a great human being he was.

00:12:48.055 --> 00:12:50.308
I'd be lying if I didn't say,
"Wow, that's a little bit

00:12:50.308 --> 00:12:52.537
of a preview of what I
want at scale as well."

00:12:52.537 --> 00:12:55.578
And so, you know it's funny,

00:12:55.578 --> 00:12:57.018
I literally said a trillion

00:12:57.018 --> 00:12:58.411
and I'm taking it back.

00:12:58.411 --> 00:13:00.269
I just can't go there.

00:13:00.269 --> 00:13:03.450
It's just not the way I want
people talking about me.

00:13:03.450 --> 00:13:05.330
- [India] That's it.

00:13:05.330 --> 00:13:06.886
- Yeah, cool.

00:13:06.886 --> 00:13:08.674
Question of the day.

00:13:08.674 --> 00:13:11.507
What percentage of dreams

00:13:11.507 --> 00:13:13.480
do you recall?

00:13:13.480 --> 00:13:15.129
(laughs)

00:13:15.129 --> 00:13:16.684
You keep asking questions,

00:13:16.684 --> 00:13:18.403
I'll keep answering them.

